  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Like the title says. The ability to add videos, and GIF, PNGs, and other cool things into your room, without uploading the whole room. It would be made permanent in the room, until you move them around. Unlike the current system, where the room resets, when it's new. The  room owner/creator could make the room un-interactivite, or visa-versa. I got this idea from the crew that made Basement VR. This would be a cool feature for people who might not know how to make their own worlds, or like the thought of changing their DEFAULT home location room. Different skybox, wallpaper, figure, and the such.",
